<Article slug="fence-permits-st-clair-shores-macomb-county">
  <p>Fence rules in our area are set by each city and township, and they differ more than most people expect. A 6-foot privacy fence that’s routine in Harper Woods isn’t allowed at all on a St. Clair Shores canal lot. Below are the rules for the communities we work in most, taken from each municipality’s own ordinance or permit packet.</p>
  <p class="notice"><strong>Check before you build.</strong> Ordinances and fees change. This guide summarizes the documents linked below as of October 2026. Confirm with your building department, and check any HOA or subdivision restrictions, which cities don’t enforce.</p>

  <h2>Quick comparison</h2>
